  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AFF 2024-2026 African Forest Ecosystems Support (PHASE II Transition) - AFF 2024-2026 African Forest Ecosystems Support (PHASE II)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">AFF 2024-2026 African Forest Ecosystems Support (PHASE II Transition)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The intervention has a two-fold objective; 

The first goal is to enhance African Forest Forum&apos;s capacity to improve livelihoods and environmental stability through better management of African Forest and Tree resources and further to achieve improved management of forest and tree resources for biodiversity conservation, livelihood and stability in Africa. 

The second goal is that AFF has achieved financial security and supports African countries to achieve sustainable forest and landscape management. This will be achieved by four components:

Component 1: Improved social and biophysical resilience through better management and conservation of forest biodiversity.

Component 2: Sustaining renewable energy in forest biodiversity hotspots.

Component 3: Strengthening AFF&#xb4;s capacity and partnership opportunities for creation and knowledge sharing for improved evidence based decision making

Component 4: Transforming AFF for sustainability.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen har tv&#xe5; m&#xe5;l: Den ska omforma AFF till att ha en f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrad kapacitet att
verka f&#xf6;r b&#xe4;ttre levnadsvillkor och h&#xe5;llbar milj&#xf6; genom en b&#xe4;ttre styrning av
Afrikas skog och tr&#xe4;dresurser och d&#xe4;rigenom bidra till en &#xf6;kad biologisk
m&#xe5;ngfald, b&#xe4;ttre levnadsvillkor och en &#xf6;kad stabilitet kontinentalt. Dess andra
m&#xe5;l &#xe4;r att AFF har uppn&#xe5;tt finansiell s&#xe4;kerhet utan Sidas st&#xf6;d och att AFF kan
bidra till en h&#xe5;llbar skog&#xad; och landskapsstyrning i Afrikas l&#xe4;nder.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The intervention has a two&#xad;fold objective; firstly it aims to transform the African
Forest Forum to enhance its capacity to improve livelihoods and environmental
stability through better management of African Forest and Tree resources and
further  to achieve improved management of forest and tree resources for
biodiversity conservation, livelihood and stability in Africa. Second goal is that
AFF has achieved financial security and supports African countries to achieve
sustainable forest and landscape management.</narrative>
  </description>
